{"id":"wb-8-277","name":"南渡广济桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南渡广济桥","text":"南渡广济桥是浙江省宁波市奉化区境内一处古代廊桥，位于江口街道南渡村西北角，奉化江支流县江上。桥梁始建于宋代，现存桥墩为元代所立，明清两代多次重修。广济桥为浙江省境内仅存的元代廊屋式桥梁，2019年被列入全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E6%B8%A1%E5%B9%BF%E6%B5%8E%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":94300502,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94300502","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b8931ec6ab577097406e9bfe.jpg","title":"Nandu_Guangji_Bridge,_2021-05-15_09.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nandu_Guangji_Bridge,_2021-05-15_09.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/18/Nandu_Guangji_Bridge%2C_2021-05-15_09.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​奉化南渡广济桥","width":320,"height":214}}